          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Bar awu heé hhawaata laqaá /ameeni gwa xarmár áy, nee tari qaátl, awuusíng ku gaasi ar kuwa tlaquuti ar tlaa/e, fu'unaywós mikiwa /aáy. Ala seebuú awu ku geemay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala bar awuusíng iqo difimaamiit, nee seebuuwós ku qo gurbuaaín, ala awu gwa ilaa/iiká, nee awu hee guri gaás, hhawaata laqaá /ameeni, awuusíng ku gaasi ar kuwa tlaquuti ar tlaa/e. Seebuú awu sleeme ku gaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes heewí kuna doohhiís as slafiingós nguwa tu/i, doohhoodá' sleémeero ngi bui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bar awu garma gwaa diíf laqaá dasi, dakós aqo kuduú kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bar awu lawaalmo gwaa diíf laqaá lawaalo'o, seebuú awu shekeéli mibeeri tám ar peésa ngi haniisi dír aakoó lawaaleedá', nee awuudá' ku tlaquuti ar tlaa/e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
