          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Bar hee bohoongw gwaa foól, nee gwa tuuntukiiká, awu iri baraadií /eét laqaá daqwaay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seebuú boohoongw i bu'un, seebuú awu laqaá daqwaay ngu bui nee awuudá' aa gwaa' ngur watli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awu bar awuú heé hatlá' gwa slahh'eés, iri gwaá', daqaní awuusíng slaáf ku weerisi, slaasláwarós kari qasiis, nee awuú aa gwaa' sleeme kuri qasiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala bar awuudá' aa intsahhán hikwaá hatlá' diftaaro, nee seebuú awu gwa tseegiiká, seebuú awu awuudá' ngu awuú hatlár bui nee kudá' aa gwaa' a kós.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
